{"name":"American Milking Devon","hex":"#63403a","fetched":"2026-10-21","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"milking","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of milk"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act by which any animal is milked.","Male masturbation (or fellatio) that leads to the release of semen, especially when performed on a milking table."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/milking"},{"term":"devon","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A type of processed meat sausage."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/devon"}],"entries":[{"title":"American Milking Devon","blocks":[{"text":"The American Milking Devon is an American breed of dual-purpose cattle, reared both for milk and for beef. It derives from the Devon cattle of the United States, which in turn are derived from the North Devon cattle of south-west England. It was established as a separate breed in 1978 with the formation of the American Milking Devon Cattle Association, after the breeding aims of the Devon were concentrated almost exclusively on beef production. It is a rare breed: its conservation status is listed as by the Livestock Conservancy as 'critical'."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/American_Milking_Devon_bull_at_Mt_Vernon_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-American_Milking_Devon_bull_at_Mt_Vernon_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_Milking_Devon","wikidata":"Q3314233"},{"title":"Milking","blocks":[{"text":"Milking is the act of removing milk from the mammary glands of cattle, water buffalo, humans, goats, sheep, and, more rarely, camels, horses, and donkeys. Milking may be done by hand or by machine, and requires the animal to be currently or recently pregnant. The milker may refer either to the animal that produces the milk or the person who milks said animal."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Mark_Milking.jpg/330px-Mark_Milking.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milking","wikidata":"Q933949"},{"title":"Devon","blocks":[{"text":"Devon is a ceremonial county in South West England. It is bordered by the Bristol Channel to the north, Somerset and Dorset to the east, the English Channel to the south, and Cornwall to the west. The city of Plymouth is the largest settlement."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Dartmoor_ponies_by_the_B3212_-_geograph.org.uk_-_4546147.jpg/330px-Dartmoor_ponies_by_the_B3212_-_geograph.org.uk_-_4546147.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devon","wikidata":"Q23156"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/American_Milking_Devon_bull_at_Mt_Vernon_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-American_Milking_Devon_bull_at_Mt_Vernon_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/American_Milking_Devon_bull_at_Mt_Vernon_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-American_Milking_Devon_bull_at_Mt_Vernon_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/American_Milking_Devon_bull_at_Mt_Vernon_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-American_Milking_Devon_bull_at_Mt_Vernon_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAmerican_Milking_Devon_bull_at_Mt_Vernon_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/AmericanMilkingDevonCalves.jpg/500px-AmericanMilkingDevonCalves.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/America